-- =============================================================================
-- Migration 010 — fix the reading and meanings of polyphonic words.
--
-- 02-build-vocab-db.ts took the FIRST reading of every complete-hsk.json
-- entry, which is often a surname or an archaic/variant reading: 都 showed
-- "surname Du", 听 "yǐn — smile (archaic)", 离 "chī — mythical beast",
-- 便宜 "biàn yí — convenient". It also padded short entries with CC-CEDICT
-- glosses from every reading of the character.
--
-- The build script now picks the reading the lessons teach, else the common
-- reading (scripts/content/word-readings.json), and only adds glosses of that
-- same reading (scripts/lib/word-forms.ts). These UPDATEs bring existing rows
-- in line with it. Row ids are unchanged, so cards, review history and deck
-- entries keep pointing at the same words. Generated by comparing the old and
-- new build logic over data/sources/complete-hsk.json.
-- =============================================================================

